    "output": "MAGPIE, which runs the sims, is not installed yet. Opened the MAGPIE setup pane: press Install there."
   }
  ],
  "tools": [
   {
    "name": "simulate",
    "description": "Runs a MAGPIE Monte Carlo simulation of a crossword (Scrabble) position and shows the results in a pane beside the conversation, with a board picture of each play: 50 plays ×5,000 iterations, 4 plies, using WMP, RIT and WIT where the lexicon has them. Use it whenever the person asks to sim, simulate or analyze a rack or position. Takes a few seconds to a minute; one at a time. Returns the top plays by win%. For a game, at most one of turn, rack, word, letters or event picks the position; when it fits more than one, the tool lists them instead of running: ask the person which."
   },
   {
    "name": "show",
